      "chunk_id": "chunk:0:98b9bb319695b231",
      "text": "这是一份演示用的研究笔记。标题前的正文会归入“文档开头”，不会重复展开后面的章节。\n",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-0",
        "node-0:0",
        "node-0:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "文档开头"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 46,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "start_offset": 0,
          "end_offset": 42
        }
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_fb80a8bbf30eeae0",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "98b9bb319695b2319b3433be0c4b698a7763e28a24476aac7e1747b2bd6551fc"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:1:b581651d94dcf354",
      "text": "解析器保留列表和引用的嵌套关系；分块器根据 token 预算选择保留完整结构或按结构边界拆分。\n\n3. 准备研究材料：整理原始文本、表格、公式和插图，保留它们在文档中的出现顺序。\n",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-3",
        "node-3:0",
        "node-3:0:0",
        "node-4",
        "node-4:0",
        "node-4:0:0",
        "node-4:0:0:0",
        "node-4:0:0:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "嵌套列表与引用"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 99,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "start_offset": 72,
          "end_offset": 120
        },
        {
          "start_offset": 121,
          "end_offset": 162
        }
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_c00a38613685f5f7",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "b581651d94dcf35472dd873d3fb5105e0b47c3d3e3b222efbffbf6963b593806"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:2:f9ebb3838bd04dc2",
      "text": "4. 分析文档结构：识别标题层级、正文节点及其来源范围，为后续分块提供结构事实。\n   - 核对原文：字符范围使用 Python 字符偏移，中文与 emoji 🙂 不按字节计算。\n   - 核对章节：直属正文与章节子树分别记录范围，目录长度依据章节子树计算。\n",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-4",
        "node-4:1",
        "node-4:1:0",
        "node-4:1:0:0",
        "node-4:1:0:0:0",
