      ],
      "section_id": "sec_e6353d70d1f5cda9",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "ee8ba104a1f2d65830a51756a0635c083d5fca5b4cee0ac0474ebcf1b174c033"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:21:fe6f068748c41819",
      "text": "$$\nS = x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} + x_{4} + x_{5} + x_{6} + x_{7} + x_{8} + x_{9} + x_{10} + x_{11} + x_{12} + x_{13} + x_{14} + x_{15} + x_{16} + x_{17} + x_{18} + x_{19} + x_{20} + x_{21} + x_{22} + x_{23} + x_{24} + x_{25} + x_{26} + x_{27} + x_{28} + x_{29} + x_{30} + x_{31} + x_{32} + x_{33} + x_{34} + x_{35} + x_{36} + x_{37} + x_{38} + x_{39} + x_{40}\n$$\n",
      "chunk_index": 21,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-12"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "表格与图片",
        "公式原子性"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 205,
      "overflow": true,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "start_offset": 4742,
          "end_offset": 5101
        }
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_e6353d70d1f5cda9",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "fe6f068748c41819e4a9f3e68498c2cffc1ececa6051ab78ae0678a6fae14b82"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:22:3980bf4a5546db6d",
      "text": "代码片段可以观察围栏在拆分后的输出中如何保留。\n\n```python\ndef prepare_document(text):\n    lines = text.splitlines()\n    cleaned = []\n    for line in lines:\n        if line.strip():\n            cleaned.append(line)\n    return \"\\n\".join(cleaned)\n\n\ndef describe_chunks(chunks):\n    records = []\n    for chunk in chunks:\n        records.append(\n            {\n                \"index\": chunk.chunk_index,\n```\n",
      "chunk_index": 22,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-14",
        "node-14:0",
        "node-14:0:0",
        "node-15"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 102,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "start_offset": 5113,
          "end_offset": 5137
        }
      ],
