    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:26:1ea2f25fa5182f41",
      "text": "代码样例包含多行代码，长度超过拆分阈值；结果会按完整代码行分段，并为每段重建完整围栏。长正文用于观察普通段落超过拆分阈值后的处理。分块器依据文本内容和结",
      "chunk_index": 26,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-16",
        "node-16:0",
        "node-16:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 80,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [],
      "section_id": "sec_a75bdb4e99183f28",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "1ea2f25fa5182f41ceda51d8eadd661e11a7a096b220d7d4cf0a9dc4018891f4"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:27:7617d64088d838a2",
      "text": "构进行拆分，目标\ntoken 数是组合时的理想尺寸，拆分阈值决定什么时候需要进一步处理较大的节点。结果中每个 chunk 都有自己的索引、文本、token",
      "chunk_index": 27,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-16",
        "node-16:0",
        "node-16:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 69,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [],
      "section_id": "sec_a75bdb4e99183f28",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "7617d64088d838a2e778c769b705ce7faf1f730ada706fdc7c010b5024874ad3"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:28:4f7341369a6ffe55",
      "text": "数和章节归属。读取这些结果时，需要区分原始节点身份与精确字符覆盖：同一个原始节点可以被拆成多个片段，因此多个 chunk 可以引用相同的",
      "chunk_index": 28,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-16",
        "node-16:0",
        "node-16:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 63,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [],
      "section_id": "sec_a75bdb4e99183f28",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "4f7341369a6ffe555173d8de3ff31a7dec89589b808a2285b004b74f33e7d41f"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:29:d2f174de9be0d0f3",
      "text": "node_id，这并不意味着它们含有相同文本。字符范围只是来源信息，不作为分块尺寸的计量单位。与此同时，表格、公式和图片等结构需要保留自身的语义边界；超宽表格行、",
      "chunk_index": 29,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-16",
        "node-16:0",
        "node-16:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 80,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [],
      "section_id": "sec_a75bdb4e99183f28",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "d2f174de9be0d0f3f69daee75f22eb529e89d5d57e094d620477bd48e1dfd888"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:30:13edd52d3c36107a",
      "text": "无法安全拆分的公式等结构会完整保留，并用\noverflow 告诉消费方该片段超过阈值。",
      "chunk_index": 30,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-16",
        "node-16:0",
        "node-16:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "Markdown 结构演示",
        "代码与长正文"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 40,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [],
      "section_id": "sec_a75bdb4e99183f28",
      "anchor_labels": [],
      "content_hash": "13edd52d3c36107a696f54b50dfcdb78cd2254afde9486cc370f91e969b43cad"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk:31:f259f673d523dc0a",
      "text": "Parser 输出结构事实，Chunking 组织章节并产生检索片段，Outline 把章节和锚点投影成简洁目录。三个 demo 使用同一份输入，便于对照不同阶段的结果。\n",
      "chunk_index": 31,
      "node_ids": [
        "node-18",
        "node-18:0",
        "node-18:0:0"
      ],
      "section_path": [
        "总结"
      ],
      "content_token_count": 64,
      "overflow": false,
      "source_spans": [
